'''Pulling Strings''' (操り職人, ''Ayatsuri Shokunin'', '''Manipulator Craftsmen''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
Starting Money UP (Sm): Wallet starts with 300¢.

